1:// Shared vocabulary for the sfvictorian-split2 build (plan.md: SITE, PALETTE, VOCABULARY).
2:// Every helper takes the build grid `g` first and writes real blocks with valid states through build.mjs.
3:// Coordinates are absolute as in plan.md: x east, y up, z south; the street is north (z0 is the sidewalk).
4:// Helpers only ADD into air; a part that calls them must not overwrite the shell.
